{'symbol': 'PEG', 'date': '2021-03-25 16:53:00', 'title': 'PSEG FOUNDATION ANNOUNCES $1 MILLION IN GRANTS TO HISTORICALLY BLACK COLLEGES AND UNIVERSITIES', 'text': 'NEWARK, N.J., MARCH 25, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE PSEG FOUNDATION HAS ANNOUNCED $1 MILLION IN GRANT FUNDING TO THREE HISTORICALLY BLACK COLLEGES AND UNIVERSITIES: HAMPTON UNIVERSITY, HOWARD UNIVERSITY AND NORTH CAROLINA AGRICULTURAL\xa0AND TECHNICAL STATE UNIVERSITY.'}